            <ArticleTitle>[Cytokines in allergic inflammatory process].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>587-603</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In our review article we intend to show the importance of IL-4, IL-5, IL-13, IL-10, IFN gamma and IL-12 in pathomechanism of allergic inflammatory process, especially in bronchial asthma. We also want to illustrate the relationships between lymphocytes T, monocytes, macrophages, eosinophils and other inflammatory cells which take part in allergic inflammation.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
